{"name":"Brazil PNCP (Portal Nacional de Contratações Públicas) search API: Illumina/NovaSeq direct contracts with values, 2023-2026","url":"https://pncp.gov.br/api/search/?q=novaseq&tipos_documento=edital&ordenacao=-data&pagina=1&tam_pagina=20","access":"Unauthenticated JSON GET (tested 12 Oct 2026, it works). Page with pagina=2..n. Rerun with q=illumina, q=%22S4%20Reagent%22, q=sequenciamento%20illumina, q=%22NovaSeq%206000%22, and tipos_documento=edital|ata|contrato (the contrato filter returned 0 for 'novaseq 6000', so use edital). For each hit, open https://pncp.gov.br/app/editais/<cnpj>/<ano>/<seq> to get the item list and homologated unit prices. Tally 6000 kits vs X kits by buyer and year.","labels":["1A","2A"],"rationale":"First pass returned 16 records. FIOTEC/Fiocruz bought NovaSeq 6000 S4 v1.5 kits in Sep 2023 and May 2024, then only NovaSeq X 10B/25B/1.5B kits from Feb 2025 to Jul 2026 (R$58K–1.05M each). That is a clean research-conversion series, which counts against a permanent tail in research. The Ministério da Saúde (INC) paid R$772,568 for a NovaSeq 6000 maintenance plan in Jul 2025, and Embrapa named the 6000 for an outsourced service on 6 Oct 2026, so 6000s are still under service in 2026. A full sweep gives per-buyer switch dates and unit prices in BRL, a public-sector LatAm conversion clock the street hasn't seen.","expected_payoff":"high"},
{"name":"US federal sole-source notices for NovaSeq 6000 service plans and reagents, FY2025-27 (SAM.gov via open mirrors), used as a census of government 6000s still kept under support","url":"https://govcontractfinder.com/contracts/maintenance-agreement-for-novaseq-6000-sequencing-system-75n98026q01014","access":"Open the mirrors without login: govcontractfinder.com (75N98026Q01014, NCI, posted 14 Aug 2026; N3239826Q4072, Navy NMRC, responses to 31 Dec 2026), console.sweetspotgov.com ('Intent to sole source for Nova 6000 Bronze Service Agreement'; 'Brand Name Illumina reagents, kits and consumables (BPA)'), oversight.govsignals.ai (75N96025Q00037; NASA 80NSSC25903768Q '6000-compatible reagents and flow cells', May 2025), samdaily.us archive. Search each mirror for 'NovaSeq 6000', 'Nova 6000', 'S4 flow cell' and 'NovaSeq X'. Record agency, posting date, period of performance and plan tier (Bronze/Silver/Gold), and count 6000 vs X notices by fiscal year. Distinct from S641 (single notice) and S709.","labels":["1A"],"rationale":"Agencies renewing 6000 service plans for periods running to 2027 are labs that plan to keep running 6000 consumables. A falling count of 6000 notices against rising X reagent notices (e.g. NIH OLAO 25B kits) gives a dated, countable decay rate for the government fleet. NASA's 2025 6000 reagent buy shows small-scale reagent pull continuing.","expected_payoff":"high"},
{"name":"Italian hospital and IRCCS 'relazione di infungibilità' and determine for NovaSeq 6000 reagents (Albo pretorio / Amministrazione trasparente)","url":"https://img.ospedalebambinogesu.it/images/2026/01/26/113054540-40a836e1-b4f2-4e33-9ff3-9f07b8357c00.pdf","access":"Public PDFs. This Bambino Gesù file (created 26 Jan 2026; Illumina attachment for CUP B53C22006140001) is Flate-compressed, so extract the text locally with pypdf (python -I) from its own folder. It is saved at the tool-results path. Then search Google for: 'NovaSeq 6000' infungibilità 2026; 'S4 Reagent Kit v1.5' determina; 'NovaSeq 6000' affidamento diretto Illumina Italy 2026; 'NovaSeq 6000Dx' consultazione preliminare. Also query ANAC open data (dati.anticorruzione.it, CIG datasets, free CSV) for supplier 'ILLUMINA ITALY' with 2025-26 CIGs, and compare object text naming 6000 vs X. Complements S868, which covers only the OPBG atti.","labels":["1A"],"rationale":"Italian law forces buyers to justify in writing why kits are 'infungibile', and that justification names the installed platform. A May 2025 OPBG report bought S1/S2/S4 v1.5 kits because they run 'exclusively' on the existing 6000. The Defence ministry (determina 492/2024) bought a 6000Dx for IVD+RUO use. 2026 versions would give dated proof of 6000 reagent buys tied to regulated or PNRR-funded work, with quantities and contract durations showing how long buyers expect to stay.","expected_payoff":"medium"},
